# Nothing secret is needed to build the site.
# Public values live in src/data/site.json (GA4 ID, Turnstile site key, form endpoint).
#
# Secrets for the form Worker live in Cloudflare, not here:
#   cd worker && npx wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET
#   cd worker && npx wrangler secret put GHL_TOKEN
#
# Optional, for local builds only:
BASE_PATH=/
